2026-11-06T03:00:24.6058702Z [0m
2026-11-06T03:00:24.6059389Z This installation tool will set up your computer with the Nix package
2026-11-06T03:00:24.6060200Z manager. This will happen in a few stages:
2026-11-06T03:00:24.6060563Z 
2026-11-06T03:00:24.6060938Z 1. Make sure your computer doesn't already have Nix. If it does, I
2026-11-06T03:00:24.6061881Z    will show you instructions on how to clean up your old install.
2026-11-06T03:00:24.6062389Z 
2026-11-06T03:00:24.6066829Z 2. Show you what I am going to install and where. Then I will ask
2026-11-06T03:00:24.6067327Z    if you are ready to continue.
2026-11-06T03:00:24.6067515Z 
2026-11-06T03:00:24.6067922Z 3. Create the system users [34m(uids [30001..30008])[0m and groups [34m(gid 30000)[0m
2026-11-06T03:00:24.6068503Z    that the Nix daemon uses to run builds. To create system users
2026-11-06T03:00:24.6069099Z    in a different range, exit and run this tool again with
2026-11-06T03:00:24.6069474Z    NIX_FIRST_BUILD_UID set.
2026-11-06T03:00:24.6069657Z 
2026-11-06T03:00:24.6069856Z 4. Perform the basic installation of the Nix files daemon.
2026-11-06T03:00:24.6070115Z 
2026-11-06T03:00:24.6070331Z 5. Configure your shell to import special Nix Profile files, so you
2026-11-06T03:00:24.6070708Z    can use Nix.
2026-11-06T03:00:24.6070904Z 
2026-11-06T03:00:24.6071027Z 6. Start the Nix daemon.
2026-11-06T03:00:24.6071186Z 
2026-11-06T03:00:24.6071494Z [32m[4;32mWould you like to see a more detailed list of what I will do?
