2026-11-06T03:00:24.6074949Z 
2026-11-06T03:00:24.6075119Z I will:
2026-11-06T03:00:24.6075386Z 
2026-11-06T03:00:24.6075776Z  - make sure your computer doesn't already have Nix files
2026-11-06T03:00:24.6076359Z    (if it does, I will tell you how to clean them up.)
2026-11-06T03:00:24.6076814Z  - create local users (see the list above for the users I'll make)
2026-11-06T03:00:24.6077217Z  - create a local group (nixbld)
2026-11-06T03:00:24.6077514Z  - install Nix in /nix
2026-11-06T03:00:24.6077806Z  - create a configuration file in /etc/nix
2026-11-06T03:00:24.6079460Z  - set up the "default profile" by creating some Nix-related files in
2026-11-06T03:00:24.6079861Z    /root
2026-11-06T03:00:24.6090931Z  - back up /etc/bash.bashrc to /etc/bash.bashrc.backup-before-nix
2026-11-06T03:00:24.6091632Z  - update /etc/bash.bashrc to include some Nix configuration
2026-11-06T03:00:24.6101111Z  - load and start a service (at /etc/systemd/system/nix-daemon.service
2026-11-06T03:00:24.6101979Z    and /etc/systemd/system/nix-daemon.socket) for nix-daemon
2026-11-06T03:00:24.6102302Z 
